                    <tr><td>Gross 손익(마찰 전)</td><td class="@Tone(a.GrossPnlWon)">@(a.GrossPnlWon.ToString("N0"))</td><td class="@Tone(h.GrossPnlWon)">@(h.GrossPnlWon.ToString("N0"))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>수수료 · 거래세</td><td>@(a.FeesWon.ToString("N0")) · @(a.TaxWon.ToString("N0"))</td><td>@(h.FeesWon.ToString("N0")) · @(h.TaxWon.ToString("N0"))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>최대 낙폭(MDD)</td><td class="ar-down">@(a.MddWon.ToString("N0")) (@(Pct(a.MddBp)))</td><td class="ar-down">@(h.MddWon.ToString("N0")) (@(Pct(h.MddBp)))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>평균 MAE · MFE</td><td>@(Pct(a.AvgMaeBp)) · @(Pct(a.AvgMfeBp))</td><td>@(Pct(h.AvgMaeBp)) · @(Pct(h.AvgMfeBp))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td title="실현 가격 이동 ÷ MFE — 순행 폭 중 챙긴 비율">청산 효율</td><td>@(Pct(a.ExitEfficiencyBp))</td><td>@(Pct(h.ExitEfficiencyBp))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td title="Σ Net ÷ Σ MAE(원) — 감수한 역행 1원당 순익(청산 적시성)">MAE 대비 실현</td><td>@(Pct(a.MaeToRealizedBp))</td><td>@(Pct(h.MaeToRealizedBp))</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>마지막 거래</td><td>@LastTrade(in a)</td><td>@LastTrade(in h)</td></tr>
